{
  "_README": [
    "REFERENCE GOLDENS — the anchor points of the warehouse-diff harness.",
    "",
    "Every number below was derived OUTSIDE the product's own calculation",
    "path: hand-run SQL against data/revi_warehouse.duckdb, some of it by the",
    "project's reviewer harness rather than by a person. Each entry records the",
    "document and passage it came from in `provenance`. The harness re-derives",
    "each one through the audit path and fails on any difference: if the audit",
    "path itself drifts, these fire first.",
    "",
    "Entries with \"v1_derivable\": false record a reference number the v1",
    "deriver deliberately refuses (snapshot-shape contracts). They are kept",
    "here, with the refusal the harness must produce, so coverage is recorded",
    "as a known hole rather than quietly dropped — and so the day the deriver",
    "grows snapshot support the numbers are already waiting for it.",
    "",
    "Cent amounts are integers of cents. Ratios/days are checked via their",
    "numerator and denominator, which is where the independent derivation",
    "lives."
  ],
